	.row.g-5
		.col-lg-5.position-sticky.mx-auto.top-0.vh-100
			h2 My approach
			p.lead.mb-4
				| I partnered with Drio Duo to resolve development challenges and bring the approved designs to life in WordPress, focusing on usability, performance, and responsive design. I also helped implement updated branding and created a Figma style guide to support future website initiatives.
			.approach-steps
				.approach-step.mb-4
					.approach-title
						i.fad.fa-magnifying-glass-chart
						h5 Assess & troubleshoot
					p Reviewed the existing implementation and approved designs to identify development challenges, usability concerns, and opportunities to improve the website's structure and functionality.

				.approach-step
					.approach-title
						i.fad.fa-laptop-code
						h5 Develop & optimize
					p Translated the approved designs into responsive WordPress experiences using Gutenberg, ACF, PHP, SCSS, and JavaScript, with attention to functionality, performance, and content management.
				.approach-step
					.approach-title
						i.fad.fa-palette
						h5 Align with new brand standards
					p Helped implement United Way's updated national visual identity across the regional website, adapting existing pages and components to the new branding.
				.approach-step
					.approach-title
						i.fad.fa-swatchbook
						h5 Document & standardize
					p Created a Figma style guide to document typography, colors, and reusable visual standards, providing a foundation for consistent future design mockups and website updates.
		.col-lg-7
			.card.bg-gradient-soft.p-4.mb-5
