				h3 Bringing the redesign to life
				p.mb-4 Drio Duo brought me in to continue the first iteration of the website redesign after the initial development encountered challenges. I worked to translate the approved designs into a responsive, functional WordPress experience, addressing implementation issues while focusing on design accuracy, usability, and performance.
